---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Developer Roadmap Library"
  description="Read the Terms & Conditions for Roadmap Library governing your use of our interactive developer roadmaps and educational content."
>
  <div class="container section-sm" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <span class="text-caption-mono" style="color: var(--color-mute);">Legal & Compliance</span>
    <h1 class="text-display-lg" style="margin: 8px 0 12px;">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-body-md" style="color: var(--color-mute); margin-bottom: 32px;">Last Updated: August 8, 2026</p>

    <div class="seo-article-body" style="color: var(--color-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Welcome to <strong>Roadmap Library</strong>! These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of Roadmap Library's Website, located at <a href="https://roadmaplibrary.com" style="color: var(--color-link);">roadmaplibrary.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">1. Intellectual Property & Use License</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Unless otherwise stated, Roadmap Library and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on Roadmap Library. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You may access this content from Roadmap Library for your own personal, educational use subjected to restrictions set in these terms and conditions.
      </p>
