      <ul style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding-left: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
        <li>Republish material from Roadmap Library without proper attribution.</li>
        <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license content or interactive roadmaps from Roadmap Library.</li>
        <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or copy materials for commercial reselling.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">2. Educational Disclaimer</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        The roadmaps, milestones, recommended frameworks, and resource links provided on this website are for general educational and career guidance purposes only. While we make every effort to maintain accurate and up-to-date recommendations for 2026, technology stacks evolve continuously. Completion of a roadmap does not guarantee specific employment or certification outcomes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">3. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        This website is provided "as is," with all faults, and Roadmap Library makes no express or implied representations or warranties of any kind related to this website or the materials contained on this website. In no event shall Roadmap Library, nor any of its officers, directors, or contributors, be held liable for anything arising out of or in any way connected with your use of this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">4. Severability & Modifications</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        If any provision of these Terms is found to be invalid under any applicable law, such provisions shall be deleted without affecting the remaining provisions herein. Roadmap Library is permitted to revise these Terms at any time as it sees fit.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">5. Questions & Contact Information</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        If you have any questions regarding our Terms & Conditions, please reach out through our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-link);">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
